&_nc_ohc=-jKlq9cJAxwQ7kNvwGPcFq-&_nc_oc=Adr-1JRjcCLKsjlN8PYAoCXfeNo3fH0ROxPqWqbVZxqSzrI2P2AwJdmvg2v1pKb8lko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO1p5ybdesuoxerGUgWRa4aqHbrwWwYNiRNffIB6CiMVw&oe=6AE34003"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PoeiIE2ZsCgQ7kNvwEON1pa&_nc_oc=Adp4mV6xWaOSLt6JV4A854rAJ_l-vIsE87pHRHRujjv--97Gz9sjGz543npktyEopug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNvVGzE4YhRKVjGhQAvOtkaBWY75eDb1Gh-9mMbvNd-0g&oe=6AE36ECB"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mYuaeUr1T9EQ7kNvwHVJPE2&_nc_oc=AdqQGol0J4RN7XBn69ZbFpz8CahI8dgj77dY7yseABrRUXbrf5PsCTPv561rc8NHTgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN21t8qOBG8zfyKgfMmo2MJdbTzltCIHilrTKOFB4AVAQ&oe=6AE34D41"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a6tnohcS1UwQ7kNvwGDiezP&_nc_oc=AdpzOZDfVZsYbsz0p_-kNOpxdOoPt3WrTgHStBPwRhnhfJ3-0UnFhYRnZW5pV9GodfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO3wmo8DT7Uyvtcfx02kC9jK_mUyGFAADuXBRfaq7n9zg&oe=6AE36684"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mo1PkExXRj4Q7kNvwGCUohM&_nc_oc=Ado4_bRvQSrgaLqx1ReJOgNzn9xv28E0w_FhMEZaxAupA4IvdPJM96eTN4JYDhrZD8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNz6G3w3tw_oBhOPqKcv3uNwNXT8tuTyL0ZhgfaNEPTqw&oe=6AE35A41"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Du3Yuk1zA18Q7kNvwEyiSdE&_nc_oc=AdoR13UGuq7XpAmxPg0XJS-deDk7p9l96DKQsv-wNFZ_DTSCxHxl3FImVtv2ZPc1xzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPOh1tLVvKdoIwMgTjyEb__pmdSV-X64q8t7JHRLU-3sQ&oe=6AE34EE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=04rgDHoYJksQ7kNvwEChgtR&_nc_oc=AdrxjO7Ljp4tN2EuIEpPIYSZv33Pr3sYiEk3lmwTvZKf2Bov1DgSR71JC4T9Yk6oDQs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPt84rTttPn0a1INp7nWBuyhHOwk8dbByizP3v34sIK1A&oe=6AE35524"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LOKEJiYU0hQQ7kNvwEjlwm4&_nc_oc=Adq7lkg1A-x7c0wxGPeh4iWN0apJBBuqVC1s66oPwOJZlSheL3RBqC61VqaPPuG8Hng&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN4_DdlWn54wUbnoPvBIzdFf2IAu1QoYJjEYwnqlswgyQ&oe=6AE357FC"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=77sArrp07XgQ7kNvwG3l56p&_nc_oc=AdoR0Gg3gt9EfuaLOLnf1A8ylXt8vyHRqHZ5fWITRMblAzl44lmzQ-o_VL76r6ARup8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPctIEnjNax77rqsOFb5u1VVcpApmzpqJlIAk7SJ8XNiw&oe=6AE342EE"}, {"file_name": "hero cover cifraria.png", "id": "955328883720100", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_955328887053433_2299564742518944745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E3aR6r1PPEUQ7kNvwFwHiGa&_nc_oc=AdrSUXAEQNnpBcfLoWNtpwYxlnPNt1OZhr6vHuuFyMLliv5QRZlBCbvoQkGQVFpoO30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO49n2uINXtwhAxfeAn-Ljqub9XSJf7DEfNpyRRWH3boQ&oe=6AE33C89"}, {"file_name": "cover_cifraria_portrait.png", "id": "923398230271609", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303790_923398233604942_8149238291275724655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2VbZdClhXkAQ7kNvwF4Nih8&_nc_oc=AdoGshljGIOC7eediFKh2zg7cUc9CA9tK2_ilC6GevI1cCTAgVUq8t6QWBmvojIWTrQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN98SrtG-wBFRueDfRYMoyWXFZj3ac5WJ84WwpT2OCDkg&oe=6AE34C56"}]}, "id": "2120506675398089", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1645036636740857", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819323_1645036640074190_2595786236772761378_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aeoCiCZZVXUQ7kNvwG9o1Ov&_nc_oc=AdpgEIUGs5efldaDXLIX2gaEAqvcdgowKE_-d6qsXIHqrBDlJvWc-_yWlIrPY6V3a_Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPsOUc3tSGD5pJ8BJeWsYJEhAp92puOYLtKGRd5C98lpA&oe=6AE337F2"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "827413820421285", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_827413823754618_7016173846081243344_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AigBmL9C3CYQ7kNvwFcqId9&_nc_oc=AdqI7mXSzwJj_5lhgYo0FZDWBhknDaWj6nmPy2xK2cgsJpCTjilBOcpuJUEReq5e5q0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOkxkDl6QJQImNiixL-djtCtpW0x4I17et--ETkmxkXQw&oe=6AE364E6"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "1684432329357395", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1684432332690728_2661215708382739758_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NPyPVFwHqHcQ7kNvwHrTq2d&_nc_oc=AdrJdOR4afyoqGc-hSoyJamDWy8NLmyDq-B0VxZWPIS93jOFA4EDtd8vnIxGLJNiwOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP5kHW_CVBBTXp4xy-ueL1ZqnFPCAEhZw90Xz43BzZsZg&oe=6AE368A3"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "991159246965883", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_991159253632549_3726168677936387175_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PWMfhDmHa8IQ7kNvwFftGgC&_nc_oc=Adq6icWCDUwClCk28vZWRL6983GNvHhriS9GlRH_kDl_Ui7H97rpgNEeTcBt8Dce-3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOHBNZvGehxCu-fi7zEPR-wBv6bCXizcBsdV2r83TeHtg&oe=6AE350A3"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "966149539200528", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_966149542533861_6133643743596760205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f2agI-yv-XMQ7kNvwG6YgKF&_nc_oc=Adp2HwWgJYH-xBlnXfPSYcmcjH6TeVifeM-QQCUt77Fa5UPbHM4ndmtUFGM6zvTen6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPZ9f3wdbTI69HuxLT3Ljur7BRzZwQcwifCuSiZmqN40w&oe=6AE34FF8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Guitar", "Chords", "Songbook", "Lyrics", "Ukulele"], "long_description": "**Cifraria** is a professional song library and guitar chord management application built with Flutter.\n\nDesigned for musicians of all levels, it offers a seamless experience for managing, transposing, and practicing your favorite songs across Mobile and Meta Quest devices.\n\n\u2728 **Features**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Smart Library Architecture**: Organise your songs into custom folders with a glassmorphism sidebar for a premium feel.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Setlist Management**: Create custom lists and organize the songs in the exact order of your performance.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Pro Sharing**: Export your setlists using the exclusive .cifraria extension via messaging apps or use the QR Code so that another device with the app can automatically recreate the list and songs.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Instant Transposition**: Change song keys on the fly with a robust transposition engine.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Cloud Sync (Google Drive)**: Securely backup and restore your entire library, including folders and favorite status.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Meta Quest Ready**: Optimized landscape mode and UI scaling for a distraction-free practice environment in Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Multi-format Import**:  Import songs from the web (one-click extraction) or local files (PDF & DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Interactive Chord Charts**: Clickable chords with automatic diagram generation, supporting both Guitar and Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Performance First**: Local database persistence for instant loading and 100% offline functionality.", "short_description": "Cifraria is a professional song library and guitar chord management application"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/18BVoWuGr5oKZaX6z0ZCklOlUod5mBmQH/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David Kalil Braga", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://davidkalil10.github.io/Cifraria_Website/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_g